</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Array</h2><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Mixed. Soli wins the bulk native transforms; Ruby wins anything that calls a block per element.</p>
<p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">One caveat on <code class="text-cyan-400">difference</code>: it is <strong class="text-white">not</strong> quite like-for-like. Soli's <code class="text-cyan-400">difference</code> deduplicates its result, where Ruby's <code class="text-cyan-400">Array#-</code> keeps duplicates from the left operand (<code class="text-cyan-400">[1, 1, 2] - [3]</code> is <code class="text-cyan-400">[1, 1, 2]</code> in Ruby, <code class="text-cyan-400">[1, 2]</code> here), so Soli is doing strictly more work in that row.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 mb-10"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-white/5 text-gray-300"><tr><th class="py-3 px-4">Operation</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Soli</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ruby</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+YJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">+ZJIT</th><th class="py-3 px-4 text-right">Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-gray-400 divide-y divide-white/10">
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">flatten</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.110</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.879</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.809</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.805</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.14&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">join</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.183</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.437</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.433</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.354</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.52&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">union</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.732</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.401</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.384</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.404</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.53&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">sum</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.007</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.013</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.013</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.013</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.56&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">includes</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.039</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.051</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.052</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.052</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.76&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">index_of</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.039</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.051</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.052</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.052</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.77&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">sort</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.165</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.327</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.334</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.344</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-emerald-400 font-semibold">0.88&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">intersection</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">1.034</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.857</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.841</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.837</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">1.24&times;</td></tr>
<tr><td class="py-3 px-4"><code class="text-cyan-400">uniq</code></td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.506</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.337</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.339</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right">0.338</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-right text-gray-400">1.50&times;</td></tr>
